zhi-046-sun-ce:p011","quote":"呉録曰：「時有烏程鄒他、錢銅及前合浦太守嘉興王晟等，各聚衆萬餘或數千。引兵撲討，皆攻破之。策母呉氏曰：『晟與汝父有昇堂見妻之分，今其諸子兄弟皆已梟夷，獨餘一老翁，何足復憚乎？』乃捨之，餘咸族誅。策自討虎，虎高壘堅守，使其弟輿請和。許之。輿請獨與策會面約。旣會，策引白刃斫席，輿體動，策笑曰：『聞卿能坐躍，勦捷不常，聊戲卿耳！』輿曰：『我見刃乃然。』策知其無能也，乃以手戟投之，立死。輿有勇力，虎衆以其死也，甚懼。進攻破之。虎奔餘杭，投許昭於虜中。程普請擊昭，策曰：『許昭有義於舊君，有誠於故友，此丈夫之志也。』乃捨之。」臣松之案：許昭有義於舊君，謂濟盛憲也，事見後注。有誠於故友，則受嚴白虎也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0111","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0100"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"「其弟輿」上承本句嚴白虎。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0111","surface":"輿","start":111,"end":112,"kind":"person","person_id":"yaq_72e_8ck","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0118","surface":"輿","start":118,"end":119,"kind":"person","person_id":"yaq_72e_8ck","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0137","surface":"輿","start":137,"end":138,"kind":"person","person_id":"yaq_72e_8ck","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0163","surface":"輿","start":163,"end":164,"kind":"person","person_id":"yaq_72e_8ck","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011:m0191","surface":"輿","start":191,"end":192,"kind":"person","person_id":"yaq_72e_8ck","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-ce"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-wu046-yu-bro